123
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:23,000
And if it's greater than the number of max revisions, we're going to end.

124
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:26,000
If not, we're going to go on to reflect.

125
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:29,000
Remember, this is getting run after the generation step.

